OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be dry with clear periods. Then
OL,7,Fthe rest of the night will be dry with
OL,8,Fclear periods, perhaps a light shower
OL,9,Flater on.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FAfter a dry morning
OL,12,Foutbreaks of rain will spread from the
OL,13,Fwest in the afternoon and early
OL,14,Fevening along with freshening
OL,15,Fsoutheasterly winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FMainly
OL,18,Fdry on Friday with sunny spells and
OL,19,Fthe odd passing shower. Rain will
OL,20,Fspread east on Saturday, drier by
OL,21,Fevening. Dry and bright on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
